OL,3,GNEWSAPippa Middleton wins battle to
OL,4,Akeep driveway private
OL,5,
OL,6,FPippa Middleton and her husband have
OL,7,Fwon a planning battle to prevent part
OL,8,Fof their driveway being designated as a
OL,9,Fpublic footpath.
OL,11,FThey moved their family to Barton Court
OL,12,Fin Kintbury, Berkshire, in autumn 2022,
OL,13,Fand installed a security gate on the
OL,14,Fpath.
OL,16,FThis prompted the West Berkshire
OL,17,FRamblers group to apply to legally
OL,18,Frecognise the path, which is about 285m
OL,19,F(935ft) long, in January 2023.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
